  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Zealand Red Cross Partnership 2018-2024 (A13126)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will build preparedness, response and recovery capacity in response to humanitarian crises, including natural disasters. With a primary focus on the Asia/Pacific region, this activity supports the deployment of skilled professionals overseas via the Delegates programme, commercial and community-based First Aid Training, management of the IT and Telecommunications Emergency Response Unit, as well as professional development within Pacific Island Red Cross National Societies.</narrative>
  </description>
